      "theory": "Asynchronous, cue-deficient digital communication fabricates a phantom intimacy that starves neurobiological needs for physical co-presence, eye contact, and authentic resonance.",
      "summary": "\"Digital Mirage\" is the melancholic, atmospheric centerpiece of Act III. It explores the painful paradox of being hyper-connected yet feeling profoundly isolated. The track contrasts sparse, weary, spoken-word raps—detailing a world of superficial online \"friendships\"—with a soaring, sorrowful, and intensely melodic female-led chorus. It’s the sound of a soul dying of thirst while looking at a beautiful, shimmering, but ultimately fake oasis of connection.",
      "clean_lyrics": "Got a thousand friends I've never met\nA million moments I'll just forget\nA wall of faces I can scroll all day\nA hundred \"hellos\" from a mile away\nIt looks like love, it feels like grace\nA perfect smile on a curated face\nBut every connection is a digital thread\nA phantom whisper from the walking dead\n\nIt's a shallow pool, a faded dye\nA beautiful front for an empty lie\nI'm sending signals no one can read\nPlanting a synthetic seed\n\nIt's a Digital Mirage! A hollow sight!\nStaring at a screen in the middle of the night!\nSurrounded by people and all alone!\nA public figure on a private throne!\nA Digital Mirage! It looks so real!\nBut I can't remember how to feel!\nI'm drowning in the static, the endless haze...\nThe lonely nights of digital days...\n\nWe sit together in a silent room\nEach one inside a digital tomb\nWe type our laughter, we text our pain\nAfraid to talk in the falling rain\nMy social muscles have turned to dust\nMy human instincts have turned to rust\nI'm fluent in emoji, but I'm losing the art\nOf looking in your eyes and showing you my heart\n\nIt's a data point, a passing trend\nAn online \"like\" from a \"friend\"\nI'm just a profile, a username...\nA moth to a digital flame...\n\nIt's a Digital Mirage! A hollow sight!\nStaring at a screen in the middle of the night!\nSurrounded by people and all alone!\nA public figure on a private throne!\nA Digital Mirage! It looks so real!\nBut I can't remember how to feel!\nI'm drowning in the static, the endless haze...\nThe lonely nights of digital days...\n\nA thousand numbers on my phone\nBut I've never felt so goddamn on my own\nI'm just a ghost, a username\nA social burnout in a social game\nI'M SICK OF TALKING TO A WALL!\nI'M SICK OF WAITING FOR A CALL!\nI'D TRADE IT ALL FOR JUST ONE TOUCH!\nIS FLESH AND BLOOD ASKING TOO MUCH?!\n\nIt's a Digital Mirage! A hollow sight!\nStaring at a screen in the middle of the night!\nSurrounded by people and all alone!\nA public figure on a private throne!\nA Digital Mirage! It looks so real!\nBut I can't remember how to feel!\nI'm drowning in the static, the endless haze...\nThe lonely nights of digital days...\n\nAll alone...\nAll alone...\nA digital mirage...",
      "musical_style": "Melancholic, atmospheric Industrial Nu-Metal ballad with a slow, heavy, and powerful chorus. Features a high-contrast two-vocal dynamic: a weary, spoken-word male rapper for the verses and a raw, sorrowful, high-energy female vocalist delivering powerful *sung* vocals for the explosive chorus.",
      "social_quote": "\"Surrounded by people and all alone.\" Our new track \"Digital Mirage\" is an anthem for the hyper-connected and lonely. #DigitalMirage #Loneliness #NuMetal #TheGlitchInTheMachine"
